-- ------------------------------------------------------------------
-- What a stone or a rune grants, in green
-- ------------------------------------------------------------------
-- AN ITEM SAYS ITS EFFECT IN THE COLOUR AN EFFECT IS SAID IN. An item's own
-- description is drawn in the yellow of a flavour text, and 3.3.5 gives an
-- item one green line only: the description of a spell it carries. So every
-- stone and every rune carries a spell of its own that DOES NOTHING -- no
-- effect, no visual, no cooldown -- and whose description is the sentence.
-- ONE RULE FOR ALL OF THEM: the spell is 85400 + (the item - 85000), so
-- the eighty stones hold 85400..85479, the pin of oblivion 85600,
-- the rank runes 85701..85857 and the statistic runes
-- 85900..85915. The item rows name them (03_items.sql, 04_runes.sql).
DELETE FROM `spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` BETWEEN 85400 AND 85915;
